
### 1. Cadastrar usuário
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/usuarios
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Usuario Teste",
  "email": "usuario.teste@example.com",
  "senha": "Teste1234",
  "dataNascimento": "2005-05-15",
  "altura": 1.70,
  "peso": 65.0,
  "sexo": "Outro",
  "objetivo": "Manter peso",
  "nivelAtividade": "Moderado",
  "restricoes": "Nenhuma",
  "condicaoSaude": "Nenhuma",
  "avaliacaoAlimentacao": 3
}

###

### 2. Fazer login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "usuario.teste@example.com",
  "senha": "Teste1234"
}

###

### 3. Listar usuários (requer JWT)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/usuarios
Authorization: Bearer COLE_SEU_TOKEN_AQUI

###

### 4. Buscar usuário por ID (requer JWT)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/usuarios/1
Authorization: Bearer COLE_SEU_TOKEN_AQUI

###

### 5. Atualizar usuário (requer JWT)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/usuarios/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer COLE_SEU_TOKEN_AQUI

{
  "nome": "Usuario Atualizado",
  "email": "usuario.teste@example.com",
  "peso": 67.0
}

###

### 6. Cadastrar usuário com e-mail inválido
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/usuarios
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Usuario Invalido",
  "email": "email-invalido",
  "senha": "Teste1234"
}

###

### 7. Excluir usuário (requer JWT)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/usuarios/1
Authorization: Bearer COLE_SEU_TOKEN_AQUI

____________________________________


